# AgentShip — example environment file.
#
# Copy this to `.env` in the directory you run `agentship` from, then uncomment
# and fill in the provider key(s) for the model(s) your agent uses. `agentship
# run` loads `./.env` automatically (or point at another file with --env-file).
# A variable already exported in your shell always wins over the value here.
#
# NEVER commit a real `.env` — it is git-ignored (only this example is tracked).

# OpenAI (models like "openai/gpt-4o-mini")
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Anthropic (models like "anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-latest")
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Other providers, as needed:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
# GROQ_API_KEY=...
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=...
# COHERE_API_KEY=...
